  m_Name: MOUNTAIN - WALKING 2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  subtitles:
  - line: "I still can\u2019t believe the village got destroyed so easily."
    seconds: 3.905
    isFromRadio: 0
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: All because I was bringing them that human equipment.
    seconds: 8.298
    isFromRadio: 0
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: Not all of the villagers would have been in the village at that time,
    seconds: 12.804
    isFromRadio: 0
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: and there are probably more populations further away.
    seconds: 17.159
    isFromRadio: 0
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: "They\u2019ll be able to recover, so long as that monster is dealt with."
    seconds: 22.566
    isFromRadio: 0
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: "And there\u2019s nobody else who can operate the reactor. It has to be
      me."
    seconds: 28.198
    isFromRadio: 0
    isIntoRadio: 0
  audioName: MOUNTAIN - WALKING 2
